            "description": "Register this URL in the PayPal developer dashboard (Sandbox → Webhooks). Signature is verified with PAYPAL_WEBHOOK_ID when set; unverified deliveries are stored but flagged.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"WH-TEST-0000000001\",\n  \"event_type\": \"PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED\",\n  \"resource\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{captureId}}\",\n    \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n    \"supplementary_data\": {\n      \"related_ids\": {\n        \"order_id\": \"{{orderId}}\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
